    "role": "Volunteer Teacher",
    "companyName": "Mt. Pleasant High School",
    "description": "Through Microsoft Philanthropies TEALS program’s training, I collaborated with 3 other software engineers to introduce AP Computer Science A at Mt. Pleasant High School. Our goal was to teach that cohort of students, as well as teaching the teacher how to teach Computer Science, as she had no prior experience. We modified the existing TEALS curriculum and created new projects and lessons together. I had an extremely rewarding time teaching those students Java and I am proud to say that the majority of the class took the AP test and passed the class.",
